(SOL-7 is a browser-native, interactive 3D space exploration simulator and decision-driven educational story game built) Tj
T* (with React 19, Three.js \(React Three Fiber\), TypeScript, and the Web Audio API. Designed for students, educators, and) Tj
T* (space enthusiasts, SOL-7 bridges the gap between passive space textbooks and complex orbital simulators.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
45.354330708661422 578.8348818897636647 Td
(Players register a personalized Astronaut Commander Dossier, walk across Earth Launch Complex 39A, launch aboard) Tj
T* (the SOL-7 Rocket to the 100 km Karman Line, navigate an interactive 8-planet + Moon 3D Solar System, execute a) Tj
T* (retro-propulsive landing on the Moon or Mars, and lead a 4-astronaut crew through 4 branching chapters grounded in) Tj
T* (real NASA Open Data \(DONKI, DSN, OSDR, and ECLSS\). Players can snap live 3D photos with the in-game EVA) Tj
T* (Camera and review them alongside their 4-Chapter Decision Flowchart Certificate.) Tj
